<mxCell id="lg5" value="Audit" style="rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=11;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1245" y="1496" width="210" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="legend_keys" value="&lt;b&gt;Badges&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;PK primary key · FK foreign key · NN NOT NULL · NULL nullable · UQ unique · UQ1 part of a composite unique key · CK CHECK constraint&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Cardinality&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;|| exactly one · o| zero or one (nullable FK) · o&amp;lt; zero or many&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;ON DELETE&lt;/b&gt; (label at the child end): CASCADE · SET NULL · RESTRICT · NO ACTION (checked at end of statement)" style="shape=note;size=14;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;fontSize=11;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#94a3b8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="120" y="1541" width="900" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="notes" value="&lt;b&gt;Composite UNIQUE (UQ1 in a table = one combined unique key)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;enrollments (user_id, course_id) · course_sections (course_id, code) · courses (code, term) · skills (course_id, name)&lt;br&gt;submissions (assignment_id, student_id, attempt_number) · test_results (submission_id, test_case_id)&lt;br&gt;criterion_scores (submission_id, criterion_id) · skill_progress (user_id, skill_id) · user_achievements (user_id, achievement_id)&lt;br&gt;submission_files (submission_id, path) · question_options (question_id, position)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Composite FOREIGN KEYS (keep related rows in the same parent)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;enrollments (section_id, course_id) → course_sections (id, course_id), ON DELETE SET NULL (section_id)&lt;br&gt;test_cases (criterion_id, assignment_id) → rubric_criteria (id, assignment_id), ON DELETE SET NULL (criterion_id)&lt;br&gt;question_answers (option_id, question_id) → question_options (id, question_id)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Partial unique indexes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;submission_files: one row with is_entry_point = TRUE per submission · question_options: one row with is_correct = TRUE per question&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Main CHECK constraints&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;max_points &amp;gt; 0 · weight &amp;gt; 0 · time_limit_ms &amp;gt; 0 · attempt_number &amp;gt;= 1 · auto_points, final_points &amp;gt;= 0 · xp_reward &amp;gt;= 0 · amount &amp;gt; 0&lt;br&gt;mastery_level BETWEEN 0 AND 1 · evidence_count &amp;gt;= 0 · runtime_ms &amp;gt;= 0 · line_start &amp;gt;= 1 · line_end &amp;gt;= line_start · position &amp;gt;= 0&lt;br&gt;criterion_scores: override_reason and overridden_at are both NULL or both set · feedback: source = 'ai' requires model_name and prompt_version&lt;br&gt;Enumerations (status, role, kind, visibility, source, feedback_depth) are VARCHAR + CHECK (value IN (...))&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Derived values are not stored&lt;/b&gt;: course level = SUM(xp_events.amount); answer correctness = question_options.is_correct of the chosen option" style="shape=note;size=14;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;fontSize=11;fillColor=#fffde7;strokeColor=#bdb76b;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1050" y="1541" width="1450" height="330" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
</root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>